  "steps": [
    "Burger mix. Combine the chicken with garlic powder, onion powder, dill, salt and pepper just until mixed; form 4 balls.",
    "Slaw. Whisk yogurt, mayo, pickle juice and seasonings; toss in green onions, cilantro, pickles and coleslaw mix. Chill.",
    "Smash. Heat oil in a cast iron skillet over medium-high until very hot. Add the balls and smash thin immediately. Cook 3–4 minutes undisturbed until deeply browned.",
    "Cheese. Flip, add pepper jack, and cook 2–3 minutes until 165 °F and melted.",
    "Assemble. Toast the buns if you like and build with slaw, burger and extra pickles."
  ],
